Q: sending and receiving data using android application, arduino, and esp8266 wifi module A: <p>I had this same problem.. in solution you can refresh your page after a fixed time (like 10sec or 20sec) on web page so your buffer code refresh and it work properly.</p>

<p>Code for that is:</p>

<pre><code>&lt;script type="text/javascript"&gt;    
    setInterval(page_refresh, 5*60000); //NOTE: period is passed in milliseconds
&lt;/script&gt;
</code></pre>
